Preparing the data
For each country, this analysis uses its most recent observation and calculates the difference between its pre-tax and post-tax Gini coefficients. It then focuses on countries where the difference is at least 0.18.

latest_inequality &lt;- income_inequality |&gt;
  filter(
    !is.na(Code),
    !is.na(gini_mi_eq),
    !is.na(gini_dhi_eq)
  ) |&gt;
  group_by(Entity) |&gt;
  filter(Year == max(Year)) |&gt;
  mutate(
    inequality_reduction = gini_mi_eq - gini_dhi_eq
  ) |&gt;
  arrange(desc(inequality_reduction))

large_reductions &lt;- latest_inequality |&gt;
  filter(inequality_reduction &gt;= 0.18)
